                      {
                        "type": "bold"
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": " "
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "I'm sorry to hear that your order arrived damaged. I understand how frustrating this must be.",
