      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 3
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Resposta modelo"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "blockquote",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Dear Ms Taylor, Thank you for letting us know, and I'm very sorry to hear that your coffee machine arrived damaged — especially as this has happened before. I understand how disappointing this must be. We'll send you a replacement today by express delivery, free of charge, and you should receive it by Friday 7 June. You don't need to return the damaged item. I've also asked our delivery team to review how this product is packed. If there's anything else I can do, please let me know. Kind regards, Ana Silva, Customer Service",
                "marks": [
                  {
                    "type": "italic"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
